  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197458",
      "title": "Setting Up our Screen Components",
      "lectureOrder": 47,
      "videoOrder": 44,
      "sourceHash": "2bdde9ae24a515d5e427139b629e516fce82948986e05f0b1e609744125c5be5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 6.13,
          "en": "So let's dive right into building this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.13,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "And for this, I am in this new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 10.39,
          "en": "and as you saw before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.39,
          "end": 13.71,
          "en": "we will have a couple of screens in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.71,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "Therefore, what I'll do as a first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 19.99,
          "en": "is I'll add a folder named screens in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.99,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "You don't have to create that folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.95,
          "en": "you don't have to name it screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.95,
          "end": 29.95,
          "en": "but I like to add my components that will act as screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.17,
          "end": 32.47,
          "en": "so that will be full size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.47,
          "end": 35.05,
          "en": "taking up the entire size off the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.05,
          "end": 37.56,
          "en": "I like to store them in such a screens folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.56,
          "end": 41.39,
          "en": "to make it clear that this will be full screen components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.39,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "And I will also add a components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.57,
          "en": "which will hold all the other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.57,
          "end": 51.57,
          "en": "that are then combined together to make up these screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 55.03,
          "en": "So in the past, in the first app we built,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.03,
          "end": 57.53,
          "en": "we only had one screen in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.53,
          "end": 59,
          "en": "and then we had that model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59,
          "end": 61.31,
          "en": "which you could count as a second screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.31,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "but it generally was all on one screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 67.96,
          "en": "and our app component did render the entire screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.96,
          "end": 70.87,
          "en": "and all the components that made up that screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.87,
          "end": 73.81,
          "en": "Now we will have multiple main screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.81,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "between which we'll switch and you will learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.19,
          "end": 79.36,
          "en": "how you can switch throughout this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.36,
          "end": 82.81,
          "en": "though we will also come back to this idea of screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.81,
          "end": 86.03,
          "en": "and navigating between screens later in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.03,
          "end": 88.023,
          "en": "when we dive into navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.96000000000001,
          "end": 92.56,
          "en": "But now we have these two folders, screens and components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.56,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "And in the screens folder, I will add three new files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "I will add a StartGameScreen.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "which will hold the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "that will act as a, well, start screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.74000000000001,
          "en": "where we pick the number that should be guessed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.74000000000001,
          "end": 110.63300000000001,
          "en": "and where we start the game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 113.71000000000001,
          "en": "I will then add a second component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.71000000000001,
          "end": 116.2,
          "en": "a second component file I should say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.2,
          "end": 118.63,
          "en": "which I will name GameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.63,
          "end": 121.4,
          "en": "This will be the component, the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.4,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "that will be responsible for the actual game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 128.71,
          "en": "So where we will see the gases by the phone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.71,
          "end": 131.99,
          "en": "and where we then let the phone know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.99,
          "end": 134.853,
          "en": "if the gas is too high or too low.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.92,
          "end": 138.95,
          "en": "And then finally we have one last screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.95,
          "end": 141.89,
          "en": "and that's the GameOverScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.89,
          "end": 145.213,
          "en": "which will be shown once the game is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.09,
          "end": 148.67000000000002,
          "en": "At the moment, all three files are empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.67000000000002,
          "end": 151.803,
          "en": "but we're going to add content throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.26,
          "end": 157.02,
          "en": "Now it makes sense to start with the StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.02,
          "end": 159.47,
          "en": "because that is the first screen we will see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.47,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "that is the screen that will allow us to pick a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 164.86,
          "en": "and then start the game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.86,
          "end": 168.11,
          "en": "Therefore I'll start by adding a new functional component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.11,
          "end": 171.24,
          "en": "in there like this and it will export it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.24,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "so that we can use it in other files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 176.77,
          "en": "And that's the first important takeaway by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.77,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "A screen, as I define it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 182.24,
          "en": "is just a regular react component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.24,
          "end": 184.25,
          "en": "a react component that will render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.25,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "react native core components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 189.33,
          "en": "and custom components which then in turn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.33,
          "end": 192.83,
          "en": "are made up of react native core components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.83,
          "end": 194.92,
          "en": "That is what a screen is, it's nothing special,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.92,
          "end": 197,
          "en": "it's just a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197,
          "end": 198.75,
          "en": "And therefore now the question is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.75,
          "end": 203.75,
          "en": "what do we want to display on this StartGameScreen?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.86,
          "end": 205.7,
          "en": "And it is of course up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 207.62,
          "en": "what you would want to display,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.62,
          "end": 210.26,
          "en": "but in this game which I have in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.26,
          "end": 212.84,
          "en": "we essentially have this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.84,
          "end": 215.99,
          "en": "where users can enter a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.99,
          "end": 217.94,
          "en": "and then we also have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.94,
          "end": 220.78,
          "en": "which allows users to confirm that number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.78,
          "end": 224.42000000000002,
          "en": "and the button which allows users to reset the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.42000000000002,
          "end": 227.48,
          "en": "and then a couple of titles around that input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.48,
          "end": 229.85,
          "en": "to provide some instructions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.85,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "Now, therefore we can start simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "by adding this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 239.68,
          "en": "And for this, we import another component from react native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.68,
          "end": 242.75,
          "en": "and this the text input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.75,
          "end": 246.923,
          "en": "which we also saw already in the first course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.79,
          "end": 250.27,
          "en": "This is a component that renders a input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.27,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "which can be used to enter data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 255.803,
          "en": "some text or in this case a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.79,
          "end": 261.25,
          "en": "Now, I don't just want to display a text input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 261.25,
          "end": 265,
          "en": "I also wanna have two buttons below that text input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265,
          "end": 269.09,
          "en": "One button for resetting and one button for confirming.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.09,
          "end": 273.42,
          "en": "And therefore we could also import button, we could do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.42,
          "end": 276.44,
          "en": "but I instead wanna build my own custom button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.44,
          "end": 278.92,
          "en": "so that you also see how this could be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.92,
          "end": 281.85,
          "en": "since this will be something you will do quite a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.85,
          "end": 283.84000000000003,
          "en": "when working with react native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.84000000000003,
          "end": 285.79,
          "en": "Because when you build your own buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.79,
          "end": 289.5,
          "en": "you have full control over their look and feel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 293.02,
          "en": "Therefore I will not add a button but I will import a view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 293.02,
          "end": 295.81,
          "en": "because I want to use a view as a container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 295.81,
          "end": 299.203,
          "en": "around my text input and those buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 300.24,
          "end": 305.24,
          "en": "So therefore here I then add my text input in that view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.41,
          "end": 310.4,
          "en": "and then below that text input, I plan on having my buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 310.4,
          "end": 312.45,
          "en": "By the way, rendering text like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 312.45,
          "end": 313.89,
          "en": "would not work as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.89,
          "end": 316.84,
          "en": "You can't output text directly in a view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.84,
          "end": 319.67,
          "en": "you would need to wrap this with a text component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.67,
          "end": 322.11,
          "en": "but here I just placed this text for me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.11,
          "end": 324.55,
          "en": "as a placeholder to remind myself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 324.55,
          "end": 327.48,
          "en": "that here I wanna display some buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.48,
          "end": 329.01,
          "en": "So at the moment, this would not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 329.01,
          "end": 331.95,
          "en": "and I'm not even running this NPM start process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 331.95,
          "end": 333.61,
          "en": "because I know that it won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 333.61,
          "end": 337.22,
          "en": "I just wanna outline this base component structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 337.22,
          "end": 338.12,
          "en": "that I wanna have.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
